{"3214330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valkyrie Rising: Hordes of Ragnarök", "steam_appid": 3214330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/50f3f1e2c69e0f49525c24fc2c50fd87.avif?t=1786556328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras_big/50f3f1e2c69e0f49525c24fc2c50fd87.webp?t=1786556328 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valkyrie Rising: Hordes of Ragnarök</strong> is Norse bullet heaven where every run pushes you closer to godlike power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/a57206883707d25c034cb84e6a75f0c8.avif?t=1786556328\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through relentless hordes, grow stronger with every choice, and forge a build powerful enough to carve through Ragnarök itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/9394ef5c716a1a818a5c0e09ecfcb3a8.poster.avif?t=1786556328\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/9394ef5c716a1a818a5c0e09ecfcb3a8.webm?t=1786556328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/9394ef5c716a1a818a5c0e09ecfcb3a8.mp4?t=1786556328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/f758cf2bad57f7c54d462763d92c674d.avif?t=1786556328\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three abilities as you level up and shape your build in the moment. Combine weapons, rune abilities, blessings, and divine powers to create synergies that stack, evolve, and turn into battlefield-breaking destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/f169cd666a71f2a3267efd336b4a4ef4.poster.avif?t=1786556328\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/f169cd666a71f2a3267efd336b4a4ef4.webm?t=1786556328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/f169cd666a71f2a3267efd336b4a4ef4.mp4?t=1786556328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/d97bf67480c1ba2a889dcad3a37ee801.avif?t=1786556328\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on quests to earn the favor of Odin, Thor, and other gods. Complete objectives under pressure, collect blessings that grant steady power, and unlock stronger divine options as the battle escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/d46974cebdac214e719e26848e2500ef.poster.avif?t=1786556328\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/d46974cebdac214e719e26848e2500ef.webm?t=1786556328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/d46974cebdac214e719e26848e2500ef.mp4?t=1786556328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/828b3a860ed8c503661c7b43118b784a.avif?t=1786556328\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Synergies</strong> – Customize your playstyle by combining weapons, rune abilities, and god powers into powerful builds that grow stronger with every choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Hordes</strong> – Overcome waves of enemies and powerful bosses that test your movement, strategy, and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Challenges</strong> – Take on quests, explore handcrafted maps, and push your skills across multiple difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong> – Unlock new combinations of weapons, blessings, quests, and upgrades that help you push deeper into Ragnarök with every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valkyrie Rising: Hordes of Ragnarök</strong> is Norse bullet heaven where every run pushes you closer to godlike power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/a57206883707d25c034cb84e6a75f0c8.avif?t=1786556328\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through relentless hordes, grow stronger with every choice, and forge a build powerful enough to carve through Ragnarök itself.</p><p 